        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-25T19:25:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"NinjaMonkey\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NinjaMonkey:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And this is the reason you read the whole card. Of course it would. I got so excited about the potential of the effect and missed i had to damage a target with the power first.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Technically, you dont have to damage the target. &nbsp;It's like Stun Bolt in that the effect is not conditional on the damage</p>",
